        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Add Baseline banner to Fullscreen API pages]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43478</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/43478"/>
        <updated>2026-03-17T15:52:50.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96150?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto">These pages were referencing the <code class="notranslate">browser-compat</code> data for the deprecated <code class="notranslate">api.Document.fullscreen</code> feature, which doesn't have a corresponding feature ID in <code class="notranslate">web-features</code>. As a result, these pages weren't displaying a Baseline banner.</p>
<p dir="auto">By removing that key from <code class="notranslate">browser-compat</code>, the features will show the correct Baseline status banner.</p>]]></content>
