<p dir="auto">This PR clarifies the behavior of the <code class="notranslate">data</code> parameter in console.timeStamp().</p>
<p dir="auto">The documentation previously implied that the <code class="notranslate">data</code> parameter is displayed in DevTools, but in practice this behavior is inconsistent across browsers. For example, recent versions of Chrome may not display this data in the Performance panel.</p>
<p dir="auto">This update adds a note to reflect browser differences and avoid confusion.</p>]]></content>
