<h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>

<p dir="auto">We're adding <code class="notranslate">loading=lazy</code> to <code class="notranslate">&lt;audio&gt;</code> and <code class="notranslate">&lt;video&gt;</code> attributes!</p>
<p dir="auto">Coming to Chrome in 147 (behind a flag): <a href="https://chromestatus.com/feature/5200068565139456" rel="nofollow">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5200068565139456</a></p>
<p dir="auto">FYI: <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/scottjehl/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/scottjehl">@scottjehl</a> <a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/hjanuschka/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/hjanuschka">@hjanuschka</a></p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>

<p dir="auto">More details:</p>
<p dir="auto"><a href="https://scottjehl.com/posts/lazy-media/" rel="nofollow">https://scottjehl.com/posts/lazy-media/</a> (with a demo of it working)<br>
<a href="https://www.januschka.com/chromium-video-lazy-loading.html" rel="nofollow">https://www.januschka.com/chromium-video-lazy-loading.html</a></p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>

<p dir="auto">Test results and supporting details<br>
Audio:<br>
